  "DIG-4172": {
    "assignee": null,
    "description": {
      "content": [
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "## Testing Mode",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "GREEN",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "## Story DD Coverage",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "- dd-2: Preplanning orchestrator surfaces the payload for approval when non-null",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "- dd-4: On decline, skips write, tags design:tokens_pending, continues",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "- dd-5: In PREPLANNING_INTERACTIVE=false mode, emits INTERACTIVITY_DEFERRED",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "## Implementation",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "1. Edit plugins/dso/skills/preplanning/prompts/ui-designer-dispatch-protocol.md: insert Section 4b after Review Loop. Logic: check design_md_additions non-null \u2192 interactive: AskUserQuestion approve/decline \u2192 approve: invoke write-design-md-additions.sh \u2192 decline: tag design:tokens_pending \u2192 non-interactive: INTERACTIVITY_DEFERRED comment.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "2. Edit plugins/dso/skills/preplanning/SKILL.md: reference new Section 4b in Phase H Step 7.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "## Acceptance Criteria",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "- [ ] Unit tests pass \u2014 Verify: bash tests/run-all.sh",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "- [ ] Dispatch protocol references write-design-md-additions.sh \u2014 Verify: grep -q 'write-design-md-additions.sh' plugins/dso/skills/preplanning/prompts/ui-designer-dispatch-protocol.md",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "- [ ] Handles INTERACTIVITY_DEFERRED \u2014 Verify: grep -q 'INTERACTIVITY_DEFERRED.*design_md_additions' plugins/dso/skills/preplanning/prompts/ui-designer-dispatch-protocol.md",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "- [ ] Handles decline with design:tokens_pending tag \u2014 Verify: grep -q 'design:tokens_pending' plugins/dso/skills/preplanning/prompts/ui-designer-dispatch-protocol.md",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "## Retry Budget",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "MAX_ATTEMPTS: 3 (sonnet model)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "On 3 consecutive sonnet failures: escalate to opus",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "On 3 consecutive opus failures (6 total): escalate to user",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
    },
